# Triumphant Chomp counts Dinosaurs you control only. Bot1 controls Prehistoric Pet (Dinosaur, power 1) and a Hill Giant (not a
# Dinosaur, power 3); Bot2 controls Raptor Companion (a Dinosaur, power 3, but Bot2's). Chomp at Bot1's own Hill Giant deals 2, not
# 3: it has 2 damage marked and lives.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Hill Giant
Prehistoric Pet
Triumphant Chomp
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Raptor Companion
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hill Giant.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Prehistoric Pet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Raptor Companion.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Triumphant Chomp.Cast(Hill Giant)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hill Giant.Damage = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Raptor Companion.Damage = 0
